<title>ITALY: Italy won't seek ERM return this weekend - official.</title>
<headline>Italy won't seek ERM return this weekend - official.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy will not seek the return of the lira to the European exchange rate mechanism (ERM) this weekend, cabinet secretary Enrico Micheli said.</p>
<p>Asked at the end of a cabinet meeting on Saturday if the government wanted to put the lira back in the ERM this weekend, Micheli replied: &quot;No&quot;.</p>
<p>He added: &quot;However the economic situation is much improved and it is a thing we will talk about in the coming days.&quot; -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
